@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Track repository and start initial synchronization
POST {{host}}/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "dotnet",
  "name": "runtime"
}

### Tracked repositories
GET {{host}}/api/repositories

### Repository
GET {{host}}/api/repositories/dotnet/runtime

### Issues
GET {{host}}/api/repositories/dotnet/runtime/issues?state=open&page=1&pageSize=20

### Pull requests
GET {{host}}/api/repositories/dotnet/runtime/pull-requests?state=open&page=1&pageSize=20

### Commits
GET {{host}}/api/repositories/dotnet/runtime/commits?branch=main&page=1&pageSize=20

### Manual synchronization
POST {{host}}/api/repositories/dotnet/runtime/sync

### Replace with syncId returned by POST /api/repositories or POST /sync
@syncId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/sync/{{syncId}}
